From: =?UTF-8?q?Micha=C5=82=20Iwanicki?= <michal.iwanicki@3mdeb.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:25:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] amdsl: dump the TIS state and retry locality 2 before the
 post-extend PCR read
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In log 7 every PCR read right after DRTM_CMD_EXTEND_OSSL_DIGEST failed
with -EAGAIN although locality 2 had been granted. Print TPM_ACCESS for
every locality and TPM_STS for locality 2 first, relinquish, wait 100 ms
and request the locality again, then read at locality 2 and at locality
0, so the next log shows the interface state the PSP left behind.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [debug]
Signed-off-by: Michał Iwanicki <michal.iwanicki@3mdeb.com>
---
 include/psp.h |  2 ++
 main.c        | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 psp.c         |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/psp.h b/include/psp.h
index 8ce6e83..fbb7604 100644
--- a/include/psp.h
+++ b/include/psp.h
@@ -89,6 +89,8 @@ bool drtm_extend_ossl_digest(u64 addr, u64 size);
 
 bool drtm_launch(void);
 
+void drtm_udelay(int us);
+
 bool drtm_get_cap(void);
 
 bool drtm_get_tcg_logs(u64 *addr, u64 *size);
diff --git a/main.c b/main.c
index 4d265cf..a657152 100644
--- a/main.c
+++ b/main.c
@@ -538,9 +538,22 @@ static asm_return_t amdsl_launch()
         print("DRTM: skl_linux: failed to extend OSSL digest\n");
     }
 
-    /* Shows which PCR the OSSL digest went to; locality 2 is held here. */
+    /*
+     * Shows which PCR the OSSL digest went to. The PSP used the TPM during the
+     * extend, so dump the interface state first, give the TPM a moment, and
+     * request locality 2 again before reading.
+     */
+    print_tpm_access("after DRTM_CMD_EXTEND_OSSL_DIGEST");
+    print("AMDSL: TPM_STS at locality 2 = ");
+    print_u64(tpm_read8(STS(2)));
+    print("\n");
+    tpm_relinquish_locality(tpm);
+    drtm_udelay(100000);
     print("AMDSL: PCRs after DRTM_CMD_EXTEND_OSSL_DIGEST\n");
     print_pcrs_at(tpm, 2);
+    print_pcrs_at(tpm, 0);
+
+    tpm_request_locality(tpm, 2);
 
     /*
      * The PSP's extends of PCR 17 and 18, at the launch and just now, are
diff --git a/psp.c b/psp.c
index 60cf80d..63b9419 100644
--- a/psp.c
+++ b/psp.c
@@ -79,7 +79,7 @@ const struct pci_psp_device psp_devs_list[] = {
 static bool init_drtm_interface(u64 base_addr, psp_version_t psp_version);
 static bool drtm_wait_for_psp_ready(u32 *status);
 
-static void drtm_udelay(int us)
+void drtm_udelay(int us)
 {
     while (us--)
         io_delay();
